    "2": {
      "note": "Tier 1 covered anatomy; Tier 2 puts it to use when you're unwell. The structure is simple: <strong>body part + tung3</strong> (痛, pain) describes any ache — <em>tau4 tung3</em> (頭痛, headache), <em>tou5 tung3</em> (肚痛, stomachache). The verb <strong>beng6</strong> (病) covers being ill generally. At the pharmacy (<em>joek6 fong2</em>, 藥房) you'll buy <em>joek6</em> (藥, medicine) — same character, different role.",
